  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1744707571_8519638_978a20782175ceff4ab37b724cc1daaf.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">In the hustle and bustle of modern life, having the right accessories can transform your daily routine into a seamless experience. At La Pendla, our vision is to empower everyone with thoughtfully designed products that integrate style and functionality, enhancing your daily commute and beyond. </span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Product description:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Thoughtfully designed for real-life professionals, this bag is the perfect solution for those who balance work, fitness, and healthy eating on the go. It features:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Separate Compartment for Shoes and Gym Clothes</strong>: Keep your shoes and workout gear neatly stored without worrying about odor or moisture affecting the rest of your items.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Lunch Compartment for Food Storage</strong>: A dedicated space for your meal prep, with room for up to two tupperwares (or one large and two smaller ones) plus ice packs. Bring your own lunch for both financial savings and healthier options.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Padded Laptop Compartment</strong>: Safeguard your tech with a padded compartment designed to fit most standard laptops.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Three Interior Pockets</strong>: Stay organized with designated pockets for your phone, keys, chargers, and other small essentials.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Dual Cupholders</strong>: Carry your water bottle and coffee mug without sacrificing space for other items.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exterior Zipped Pocket</strong>: Easily access your commuter card, wallet, phone, and keys with this quick-access zipped pocket, which also doubles as a slip-through feature to securely slide onto your suitcase handle for easy travel.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Convertible Handles</strong>: If the bag feels heavy, simply convert the handles and wear it as a backpack for added comfort and versatility.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Designed for those who commute by train, bus, or car, this is more than just a laptop bag&mdash;it's a workbag for people who need to carry their whole day with them. Whether you're heading to the gym or bringing your lunch, this commuter bag adapts to your life, making it the only bag you&rsquo;ll ever need.</span></p>",
